==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|violently}}; equivalent to {{suffix|en|violent|ly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈvaɪ(ə)ləntli/}}
* {{hyph|en|vi|o|lent|ly}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-violently.ogg|a=US}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In a [[violent]] manner.
# To an [[intense]] degree; [[extremely]]; [[strongly]]; [[intensely]].
#: {{ux|en|I found myself '''violently''' disagreeing with him.}}
#* {{quote-book|1=en|year=1982|author=w:Douglas Adams|title=Life, the Universe and Everything|page=112|text=Arthur started to choke '''violently''' on his drink.}}

